# CATALOG-BOUNDS: the Gateway catalog answers 2097152 bytes, past xfx's old
# 1 MiB cap and under fx's 16 MiB, padded before the catalog, so a read cut
# short of it is no catalog: fx reads it whole, and `/model` lists its rows.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
models p5-input-models.json
modelspad 2097152 head
wait 4
type /model
key Enter
wait 3
snap menu
gwlog
